              visible: JR,
              highlighted: ["RL","RM","RN"] },
            { text: "Next, since by hypothesis the square on {OR} equals equals the square on {AB} minus the square on {LO},",
              visible: JR,
              highlighted: ["OR","AB","OL"] },
